1316
00:31:32,724 --> 00:31:33,992
OUR PANEL OF JUDGES--

1317
00:31:33,992 --> 00:31:35,761
MISS JANICE DICKINSON.

1318
00:31:35,761 --> 00:31:37,028
JANICE IS ONE OF THE WORLD'S

1319
