1384
00:33:00,378 --> 00:33:01,413
IT'S JUST YOU GET RELAXED

1385
00:33:01,413 --> 00:33:02,681
IN PUSHING YOUR BUTT OUT,

1386
00:33:02,681 --> 00:33:03,281
BUT YOU HAVE TO SUCK

1387
00:33:03,281 --> 00:33:04,416
YOUR STOMACH IN AT THE SAME
TIME.

1388
00:33:04,416 --> 00:33:05,684
AND IT'S REALLY HARD.

1389
00:33:05,684 --> 00:33:06,751
BUT YOU DON'T HAVE TO

1390
00:33:06,751 --> 00:33:08,687
LOSE WEIGHT OR ANYTHING, OKAY?

1391
00:33:08,687 --> 00:33:09,354
Cassie: OKAY.

1392
00:33:09,354 --> 00:33:10,689
Tyra: KELLE.

1393
00:33:10,689 --> 00:33:11,423
